to everything that we're gonna get into today.

99
00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:15.210
Yeah, well, I could say interesting,

100
00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.440
but that could mean a gazillion things.

101
00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:20.520
So, I'll be a little more specific.

102
00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:24.630
You know, I have to say, my wife taught me this term, FGO,

103
00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:26.230
I'm sure many folks know what that is,

104
00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:29.070
but I had not heard it as of a few years ago,

105
00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:31.275
the freaking growth opportunity,

106
00:04:31.275 --> 00:04:34.557
you can make that R rated if you want.

107
00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:36.400
Yeah.
But man,

108
00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.840
this has been such a growth opportunity here,

109
00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:42.570
in terms of kind of all this adversity coming up,

110
00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:46.950
and leaning in rather than running away.

111
