instead of sugar, you know, oops.

1212
00:48:29.170 --> 00:48:33.030
And we eat it and we go, "Ugh, what idiot?"

1213
00:48:33.030 --> 00:48:35.050
You know, "Boy, this is not very rewarding."

1214
00:48:35.050 --> 00:48:36.550
And we get this negative prediction error,

1215
00:48:36.550 --> 00:48:39.187
that says, "Man, don't go back to that bakery again,"

1216
00:48:39.187 --> 00:48:40.370
okay?
Right.

1217
00:48:40.370 --> 00:48:43.360
So, that's how reward value is updated,

1218
00:48:43.360 --> 00:48:46.270
all based on one thing, which is awareness.

1219
00:48:46.270 --> 00:48:48.970
We have to pay attention to the behavior,

1220
00:48:48.970 --> 00:48:50.700
or we're just gonna keep doing it.

1221
00:48:50.700 --> 00:48:51.533
Right.

1222
00:48:51.533 --> 00:48:53.210
And you can see how this applies to addictions.

1223
